  "title": "International Precipitation Radar",
  "description": "Precipitation radar time series providing hourly, 12-hour and 24-hour precipitation accumulation estimates from Finland's national weather service (FMI), combined with composite rain rate radar output from the UK Met Office. Covers the North Atlantic and Northern Europe as an Icechunk-backed Zarr dataset.",
